WEBVTT

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.520
These aren't Seeno Evils!

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.520
They're Haters.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.690
You've done too much to stand out in this world.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.400
This way!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.100
What are Haters?!

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:53.520
Envy and spite created Haters of you girls
from among the Seeno Evils.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.350
They don't have the guts to show
their faces, but they do have madness.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.020
They're strong in groups.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.150
Maybe as strong as a boss.

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:03.060
Run or hide.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.230
They're after you:
the "heroes" in the limelight.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.270
We're "heroes"?

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.310
Is your cut okay?

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:21.060
Great. What's your name?

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:24.230
Yae Yoshida.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.100
Yae, huh?

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.100
Hide here until the bell rings.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:32.940
You can't clear the mission if you don't fight.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:36.480
Well, focus on maintaining
the status quo for today.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.440
I have a solution in mind.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.480
But Yae is hurt.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.410
It's my fault she--

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:42.900
Not a problem.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:46.560
She'll regenerate in as little
as ten minutes in her Egg.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.810
Damn, they found us?

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:54.400
Protect the Egg girl until time runs out.
That's your top priority.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.060
Society is built on "report, contact, consult."

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.270
Say it out loud and share it.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.770
Our greatest objective is...

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.060
...Wonder...

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.150
...Egg...

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:06.900
...Priority.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:16.940
Wonder Egg Priority

